From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:33:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the sh4-mingw32ce target (Windows CE SH-4, PE machine
 0x01a6)

* bfd: new pe-sh4-wince-little / pei-sh4-wince-little vectors that read
  and write IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_SH4 (0x01a6) and map it to bfd_mach_sh4.
* gas: sh-*-mingw32ce uses em=wince-pe and the new object format; handle
  BFD_RELOC_RVA (.rva) in md_apply_fix, which dlltool's import tables use.
* ld: new sh4_wince_pe emulation: image base 0x10000, section alignment
  0x1000, subsystem Windows CE GUI 5.00, no base relocations by default.
* dlltool: new "sh4-wince" machine with an SH jump stub, the default for
  sh4-mingw32ce.
* objdump: label subsystem 9 as "Wince GUI".
